invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_flight.c
catches: webpki_encrypted_exts_test
reason: the EncryptedExtensions handler stops seeding
  ch_tls.server_cert_type with CH_CERT_TYPE_X509, so a server that sends
  no server_certificate_type leaves whatever the field held before. RFC
  9846 §4.5.1 makes that server's Certificate message an X.509 chain,
  and the session would read it as a raw public key.
  bin/webpki_encrypted_exts_test's absent-extension row starts from a
  session that holds RawPublicKey, and it objects.

--- old
    t->server_cert_type = CH_CERT_TYPE_X509;
--- new
    (void)t->server_cert_type;
